THE TOURNAMENT SIMPLEX — macmini-2026-06-10-S2
M = I + S rows = cube vertices; vol = det(M)/n!; Gram = I + SS^T
d2_ij = 4(1 + disagree(i,j)) = 4(n-1) - 4(cod+ + cod-) = 4*Hamming(row_i,row_j)

==============================================================================
QR_7 (Paley) SPOT CHECK
==============================================================================
det(M) = 512 (DRT ceiling (n+1)^3 = 512); vol = 512/5040
Gram off-diagonal values: {-1}  => Gram = 8I - J: True
pairwise squared distances: {16}  => all = 2n+2 = 16, edge = 4 = sqrt(2n+2)
REGULAR simplex: True; edge sqrt(2n)=sqrt(14) does NOT fit at odd n.
Pfaffian vector w = [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7] (vertex-transitivity => w ∝ 1)
SS^T = 7I - J (DRT): True

